# Allowlist: the image build needs the crate manifest, its lockfile, the Rust
# sources and the SQL migrations the library embeds at compile time. Nothing
# else enters the build context, so local databases, .env files, build output,
# git metadata, agent worktrees (.claude/), sample data and docs cannot be
# baked into the image by accident.
*
!boxscore/Cargo.toml
!boxscore/Cargo.lock
!boxscore/src/
!boxscore/migrations/

# Defence in depth inside the allowed paths (later rules win).
**/target/
**/.git/
**/.claude/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/data/
**/*.jsonl
